  "body": "In Europe, YouTube recently started redirecting to a GDPR consent page that makes the URL preview useless.\r\n\r\nHowever, this redirect does not happen when the user agent starts with \"curl\".\r\n\r\nIt would be nice if I could override the user agent for the URL preview client to make these previews work again.",
